<ns0:para id="fs-id1167829590527">For a man of height <ns1:math><ns1:mrow><ns1:mn>5</ns1:mn><ns1:mo>′</ns1:mo><ns1:mn>11</ns1:mn><ns1:mo>′</ns1:mo><ns1:mo>′</ns1:mo></ns1:mrow></ns1:math> the mapping below shows the corresponding Body Mass Index (BMI). The body mass index is a measurement of body fat based on height and weight. A BMI of <ns1:math><ns1:mrow><ns1:mn>18.5</ns1:mn><ns1:mo>–</ns1:mo><ns1:mn>24.9</ns1:mn></ns1:mrow></ns1:math> is considered healthy.<ns0:newline />
